# Facts about Professor Brask.

@fact brask.beasts
tier: surface
text: Teaches Beastcraft & Flight from the stables, and talks to every creature in them more kindly than to students.

@fact brask.stories
tier: personal
unlock: seen(brask_shovel) > 0
text: Every one of her stories ends with a bite and a moral. She laughs out loud about once a term.

@fact brask.owl
tier: personal
unlock: seen(brask_night_owl) > 0
text: The old barn owl in the stable loft has outlived three of her colleagues. She would not say which loss hurt most.

@fact brask.courtesies
tier: personal
unlock: seen(brask_trust) > 0
text: She bows to the things that live in the Whisperwood, and believes it's why they have never bitten her. Much.
